&lt;li data-ck-s=&quot;1648&quot; data-ck-e=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;A genuine understanding of how Korean financial institutions make technology decisions, including the role of regulators, internal risk/compliance functions, and IT governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ck-s=&quot;1826&quot; data-ck-e=&quot;2019&quot;&gt;Direct experience navigating Financial Supervisory Service (FSS) requirements and review processes — this is required given how heavily FSS oversight shapes technology adoption in Korean FSI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ck-s=&quot;2019&quot; data-ck-e=&quot;2154&quot;&gt;A track record of managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles typical of FSI, including rigorous security and compliance review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ck-s=&quot;2154&quot; data-ck-e=&quot;2235&quot;&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets within financial services accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ck-s=&quot;2235&quot; data-ck-e=&quot;2295&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills in both Korean and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-ck-s=&quot;2295&quot; data-ck-e=&quot;2341&quot;&gt;A passion for AI built and deployed safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-ck-s=&quot;2341&quot; data-ck-e=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
