&lt;li data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;745&quot;&gt;Bonus at Target Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; 15% (~£16,223, with potential for upside. For reference, with the organization’s current performance multiplier, this amount would be £18,981 in 2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;901&quot; data-end=&quot;956&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;901&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;Estimated Total Compensation at Target: £124,373+&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
